OL,3,ABody of world's youngest traditional
OL,4,Aking returns home to Uganda amid
OL,5,Asuccession row
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe body of a popular traditional ruler
OL,8,Fwho was the world's youngest reigning
OL,9,Fmonarch has been flown home to Uganda
OL,10,Fwhere President Yoweri Musveni was
OL,11,Famongst the mourners gathered at
OL,12,FEntebbe airport to pay their respects.
OL,14,FKing Oyo Nyimba Kabamba Iguru Rukidi IV
OL,15,Fdied in the US last week aged 34 after
OL,16,Freceiving treatment for an aggressive
OL,17,Fform of cancer.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
