OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABody of world's youngest traditional
OL,4,Aking returns home to Uganda amid
OL,5,Asuccession row
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Tooro king will be buried next
OL,8,FSaturday - the day he had hoped to
OL,9,Fcelebrate the anniversary of his
OL,10,Fcoronation. He had ascended the throne
OL,11,Faged just three and was crowned when he
OL,12,Fturned 18.
OL,14,FThe return of his body marks the start
OL,15,Fof the Tooro kingdom's official
OL,16,Fnine-day mourning period amid a growing
OL,17,Fdispute over who should succeed him.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
